sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Aplicación Web/Móvil
    participant Filter as JwtAuthenticationFilter
    participant JWT as JwtTokenService
    participant API as Recurso protegido

    Client->>Filter: Request + JWT
    Filter->>JWT: validate(token)
    JWT-->>Filter: Token inválido/expirado
    Filter-->>Client: 401 Unauthorized
    Client->>API: No ejecuta operación protegida